WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:07.995
"Soon it will be spring," said Dad.

2
00:00:07.996 --> 00:00:11.237
"We can plant seeds in the garden."

3
00:00:11.238 --> 00:00:14.623
"Yeah," said Oliver.

4
00:00:14.624 --> 00:00:20.053
"I'll plant corn!"

5
00:00:20.054 --> 00:00:23.219
Harry laughed.

6
00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:27.222
"Corn grows really big," said Harry.

7
00:00:27.223 --> 00:00:30.706
"And you are really small."

8
00:00:30.707 --> 00:00:33.685
Oliver frowned.

9
00:00:33.686 --> 00:00:37.879
"I'll grow big," said Oliver.

10
00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:41.416
"Yes," said Mom.

11
00:00:41.417 --> 00:00:48.202
"You just need time to grow."

12
00:00:48.203 --> 00:00:50.936
Spring came.

13
00:00:50.937 --> 00:00:54.198
Everybody went to the garden.

14
00:00:54.199 --> 00:01:01.543
"I'll make rows for the seeds," said Dad.

15
00:01:01.544 --> 00:01:05.961
Dad made three rows.

16
00:01:05.962 --> 00:01:10.479
Oliver planted corn in row one.

17
00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:14.110
He covered the seeds with soil.

18
00:01:14.111 --> 00:01:20.594
Harry planted beans in row two.

19
00:01:20.595 --> 00:01:25.078
Emmy planted carrots in row three.

20
00:01:25.079 --> 00:01:32.191
Mom watered all the rows.

21
00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:36.954
A week later the kids ran to the garden.

22
00:01:36.955 --> 00:01:39.403
"Look!" said Harry.

23
00:01:39.404 --> 00:01:42.792
"The beans grew!"

24
00:01:42.793 --> 00:01:48.690
"The carrots grew!" said Emmy.

25
00:01:48.691 --> 00:01:51.562
Oliver looked sad.

26
00:01:51.563 --> 00:01:56.574
"The corn didn't grow," he said.

27
00:01:56.575 --> 00:01:59.263
"Don't worry," said Mom.

28
00:01:59.264 --> 00:02:03.083
"The corn will grow."

29
00:02:03.084 --> 00:02:07.452
The next week everybody ran to the garden.

30
00:02:07.453 --> 00:02:11.486
"The beans are big!" said Harry.

31
00:02:11.487 --> 00:02:16.865
"The carrots are big!" said Emmy.

32
00:02:16.866 --> 00:02:19.925
Oliver looked worried.

33
00:02:19.926 --> 00:02:25.612
"The corn didn't grow," he said.

34
00:02:25.613 --> 00:02:30.757
"It will grow," said Mom.

35
00:02:30.758 --> 00:02:34.826
The next week the corn was big!

36
00:02:34.827 --> 00:02:37.943
"Yeah!" said Oliver.

37
00:02:37.944 --> 00:02:42.440
"The corn grew a lot!"

38
00:02:42.441 --> 00:02:44.173
Harry laughed.

39
00:02:44.174 --> 00:02:47.011
"But you're still small!"

40
00:02:47.012 --> 00:02:58.393
"No, I'm not," said Oliver.

41
00:02:58.394 --> 00:03:09.862
"Look! I grew too!"

